{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09336","headline":"月溪与幼遐君贶同游 · 韦应物","name":"月溪与幼遐君贶同游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岸筱覆廻溪，廻溪曲如月。\n沈沈水容绿，寂寂流莺歇。\n浅石方凌乱，游禽时出没。\n半雨夕阳霏，缘源杂花发。\n明晨重来此，同心应已阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}